msgstr "Chatta con Wander"

#: ai/templates/ai/chat.html:393
msgid ""
"Tell me what kind of trip you're thinking about - dates, budget, climate, "
"anything."
msgstr "Dimmi che tipo di viaggio hai in mente - date, budget, clima, qualsiasi cosa."

